Modern Warfare Season 3 brings new  content to Modern Warfare itself as well  as the standalone warzone let's break  down all the important info you need to  know season 3 kicks off on April 8th and  the first batch of goodies drops during  launch week to start there are three new  6v6 multiplayer maps tall seek backlot a  remaster of a map from the original game  is a desert city with construction going  on in the center it should be a good map  for both close quarters and long range  firefights Kovach sawmill is a brand-new  three lane map set in a village with a  sawmill currently on fire you can battle  in the fiery rubble in other shops in  town or above on various rooftops  finally there's a Naya incursion a twist  on the existing anaya palace map this is  an enclosed portion of that map intended  for smaller team sizes multiplayer  playlists featuring these maps will be  continually released as the season moves  forward warzone isn't left out either  you'll be able to play quads in both  battle royale and plunder warzone we'll  also get more modes and playlists as the  season continues additionally activision  promised more weapons speaking of which  the SKS sniper rifle and Renetta pistol  are joining both warzone and modern  warfare in season 3 so that answers what  and where you'll be playing but if  you're wondering who is joining the  roster the answer is Alex one of the  game's heroes is also the newest  operator he'll be playable in both  modern warfare and war zone you can get  Alex via the season 3 battle paths or  battle pass bundle the pass alone will  run you a thousand Co D points while the  bundle costs twenty four hundred the  battle pass has a hundred tiers of  rewards to unlock but the bundle will  instantly get you the first twenty which  includes a new category vehicle skins in  addition to Alex more operators will  join the fight in the coming weeks  Activision specifically named Ronin and  East scrub new maps are also coming  during the season  these include hardhat for standard  multiplayer and aisle eight for gun  fight the new maps will launch alongside  new modes including gun game reloaded  reinfected ground war activision also  teased a new classified weapon more  gunsmith customs and a scope sin shatter  guns mode for warzone in which you'll  only be able to wield snipers and sha DS  those are the highlights of modern  warfare season 3 and if you want to see  them in action GameSpot will have tons  of gameplay to check out too good luck  soldier
 

